        "original_id": "8a711f29-ae28-52b8-a31e-6416b53ff289",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Xavier Malisse, Gene Mayer, Ruben Bemelmans, Jamie Delgado, Ken Skupski\n- Events: 1982 Bavarian Tennis Championships, 2012 Farmers Classic – Doubles\n- Topics: tennis careers, tournament titles\n\nFacts:\n- Gene Mayer was born on April 11, 1956, and he is a former tennis player from the United States.\n- Xavier Malisse was born on July 19, 1980, and he is a retired professional tennis player from Belgium.\n- Gene Mayer won the singles title at the 1982 Bavarian Tennis Championships.\n- Gene Mayer won 14 singles titles during his career.\n- At the 2012 Farmers Classic – Doubles, Xavier Malisse and fellow Belgian Ruben Bemelmans defended the title by defeating Jamie Delgado and Ken Skupski 7–6, 4–6, [10–7] in the final.",
